---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout 
	title="Terms and Conditions" 
	description="Read our terms and conditions for using the CountDaysBetween tool and website.">
	<section class="mb-24 w-full prose dark:prose-invert" style="width:100%; max-width:800px; margin-left:auto; margin-right:auto;">
		<div class="prose-content w-full">
			<h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-semibold tracking-tighter mb-8" style="width:100%; max-width:800px">Terms and Conditions</h1>
			<p class="text-lg text-body mb-8" style="width:100%; max-width:800px">Last updated: June 11, 2026</p>

			<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4" style="width:100%; max-width:800px">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
			<p style="width:100%; max-width:800px">
				By accessing and using CountDaysBetween.com, you accept and agree to be bound by the terms and provision of this agreement.
			</p>

			<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-12 mb-4" style="width:100%; max-width:800px">2. Use of Site</h2>
			<p style="width:100%; max-width:800px">
				This site provides date calculation tools for informational purposes. While we strive for accuracy, we do not guarantee that the calculations are free from errors. You use the tools at your own risk.
			</p>

			<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-12 mb-4" style="width:100%; max-width:800px">3. Intellectual Property</h2>
			<p style="width:100%; max-width:800px">
				The content, design, and logic of the tools on this website are the property of CountDaysBetween.com and are protected by copyright laws. You may not reproduce or distribute any part of the site without permission.
			</p>

			<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-12 mb-4" style="width:100%; max-width:800px">4. Disclaimer of Liability</h2>
			<p style="width:100%; max-width:800px">
				CountDaysBetween.com shall not be held liable for any damages arising out of the use or inability to use the tools provided on this website.
			</p>

			<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-12 mb-4" style="width:100%; max-width:800px">5. Modifications</h2>
			<p style="width:100%; max-width:800px">
				We reserve the right to modify these terms at any time. Your continued use of the site following any changes signifies your acceptance of the new terms.
			</p>
		</div>
	</section>
</Layout>